WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.475
Step three.

2
00:00:01.475 --> 00:00:03.840
Lay the back down, inside up.

3
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.595
Hold the blue frame wheel with its dial just past the edge.

4
00:00:07.595 --> 00:00:12.905
Lay its neck in the fork, then slide it toward the long round post until its teeth

5
00:00:12.905 --> 00:00:14.524
touch the end of the post.

6
00:00:14.524 --> 00:00:17.899
The wheel turns freely, and it does not lift out.

7
00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:22.524
If it does lift out, it was not all the way home: move it toward the edge,

8
00:00:22.524 --> 00:00:24.889
press it down into the fork, and move it back.

